e toy clit sucker vibrator red\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></p>\n<p>Twelve modes, one speed dial — the tuning most roses leave out.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Flaming Rose telescopic vibrator with 12 adjustable-speed frequencies, food-grade silicone and 2-hour runtime from a 2-hour USB charge.</p>\n",
